      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/EZMFBb3AFNMIPq27T4iZTs4fz8now5qCi4exWiB9y5RHPwYAFrfa4vcs-rQoS1CM3vi-brcYdA=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "🔥✊🏾Former Athlete For Bermuda…Racing In California …1994 Puerto Rica CAC Games…Cuba…Canada…And On The East Coast…Had To Answer A L😳t Of Questions About My Island Home…Especially About The Bermuda Triangle And How Got 🤣it…We Had A Cycle Race Called The Bermudan Grand Prix Stage Race…We Had Sean Yates From England Win The Front Street Criterium…Watching Him Live Was Unreal …Also George Hincapie Tyler Hamilton And Cristian VanDe Velde From US Postal Came One Year As Well…Alonge With Our Lone Professional Cyclist Elliot Hubbard…Narrator Is Missing  Some Inf🤔 Tho…Im A Year From 60 And Before My Tyme There Were Train Here… And Maybe Before Then Bermuda Produced And Shipped BERMUDA ONIONS!!…Alas Land Not Being Plentiful As Y’all Can S👀…Both Trains And Onions Died Off…Th🙏🏾nx For The Video Of Bermuda!!…👊🏾💯",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-30T02:15:08Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
